        ],
        "rationale": "The proposed edit is unsupported because it introduces an inaccurate substantive requirement: it states that administrative offset requires 'execution by the debtor of a written agreement', whereas paragraph (4) requires only giving the debtor 'an opportunity to make a written agreement'.",
        "verdict": "unsupported"
